Subject: [PATCH] Preserve full float RGB diffuse/glossy light-pass fractions
 in main and shadow GPU state so independent half rounding cannot leak
 non-transmitting reflection into an unreconstructable transmission remainder;
 retain the remaining compact state and Beauty estimator.

